  "prefLabel": "Ph 308.01 Grounds for Revocation or Suspension",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-04-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 308.01 Grounds for Revocation or Suspension. The board may revoke or suspend a permit to operate a pharmacy for grounds which include but are not limited to:\n\n(a) Misconduct as described in RSA 318:29, II; and\n\n(b) Violations of the provisions of RSA 318:29, V.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
